### Travelog API · IntelliJ HTTP Client
### 先执行登录，复制 accessToken 到 @token

@base = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### 健康检查
GET {{base}}/health

### 发送验证码
POST {{base}}/auth/sms/codes
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"13800000000"}

### 登录
POST {{base}}/auth/sessions/sms
Content-Type: application/json

{"phone":"13800000000","code":"123456"}

> {%
  client.global.set("token", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}

### 我的资料
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 城市搜索（拼音前缀）
GET {{base}}/cities?q=da&size=10

### 城市搜索（省份）
GET {{base}}/cities?q=云南&size=10

### 当前城市与定位进度
GET {{base}}/cities/current
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 回忆盒列表
GET {{base}}/memory-boxes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 创建回忆盒
POST {{base}}/memory-boxes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"杭州 · 新的回忆","cityAdcode":"330100","template":"magazine"}

### 发布「此刻」
POST {{base}}/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"NOW","city":"杭州","place":"断桥残雪","area":"西湖景区","content":"断桥这会儿人少了，风大记得带外套。","onSite":true,"imageUrl":"/photos/pic05.jpg"}

### 公共内容列表
GET {{base}}/posts?type=NOW&size=10

### 开启共享
POST {{base}}/share/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"distanceBand":"ONE_KM"}

### 同城大厅
GET {{base}}/share/hall
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 喜欢（u1 会互相喜欢 → 自动建队）
POST {{base}}/share/likes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"toUserId":"u1"}

### AI 会话
POST {{base}}/ai/conversations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"city":"杭州"}

### AI 提问
POST {{base}}/ai/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"今天下午去哪"}

### 公开分享链接（种子）
GET {{base}}/share-links/dali7k9

### 后台指标（演示账号是管理员）
GET {{base}}/admin/metrics/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 后台审核列表
GET {{base}}/admin/reviews?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
